{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/fd85cafba251f74f029fc1917e23dfbd.poster.avif?t=1768210423\" width=878 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/fd85cafba251f74f029fc1917e23dfbd.webm?t=1768210423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/fd85cafba251f74f029fc1917e23dfbd.mp4?t=1768210423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>FEAR FA 98 is an arcade soccer game with a blood-soaked twist. Play alone (in the dark) or in a horrendously violent two-player match! It combines the competitive elements of the soccer world with the classic horror tropes that made series like Silent Hill or Manhunt great. Play against the computer, massacre your friends in a terrifying afternoon worthy of the '90s, or dive into an adventure mode packed with grotesque NPCs, sinister puzzles, and macabre stories.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/0238927ec55df34c0c39b0f527cf2e62.poster.avif?t=1768210423\" width=878 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/0238927ec55df34c0c39b0f527cf2e62.webm?t=1768210423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/0238927ec55df34c0c39b0f527cf2e62.mp4?t=1768210423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEAR FA 98 is an arcade soccer throwback that aims to recreate the fast-paced, dynamic matches of \u201990s youth. Choose your team\u2014each with exclusive weapons and demonic summons\u2014to shred your opponents. During the match, the pitch itself turns against you, with monsters and traps appearing to make the game even more chaotic.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But don\u2019t worry\u2014your players aren\u2019t helpless. Feel free to use a myriad of weapons to drain the opposing team\u2019s strength. Wield axes, stab with syringes, and most dangerous of all, run with scissors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And of course, you can always summon ancient demons to aid you in your brutal, ball-based battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/47b79da5b398fe3a27cd8f5045c96763.poster.avif?t=1768210423\" width=878 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/47b79da5b398fe3a27cd8f5045c96763.webm?t=1768210423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/47b79da5b398fe3a27cd8f5045c96763.mp4?t=1768210423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Enjoy the first horror game to combine soccer simulation with terror</strong>: A unique blend of classic soccer gameplay and terrifying horror elements.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield weapons during matches</strong>: Players can unleash knives, axes, and even firearms while competing on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon demons</strong>: Soccer brings out the worst in some people. Channel this darkness to summon monstrous creatures that attack opponents and alter the course of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous stadiums</strong>: Navigate fields filled with traps, monsters, and hidden dangers that disrupt the flow of the match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer madness</strong>: Supports 2-player local multiplayer, delivering both competitive gameplay and the retro feelings of warmth\u2026 and incandescent rage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story mode</strong>: Uncover the intricate and thrilling horror story behind <i>FEAR FA 98</i> and its connection to the Jacob Jazz universe, where Earth is ravaged by entities humanity will soon discover have been living inside the sun for centuries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/511f1e11b37c71a4feab62bc0aa8fd1e.poster.avif?t=1768210423\" width=878 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/511f1e11b37c71a4feab62bc0aa8fd1e.webm?t=1768210423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/511f1e11b37c71a4feab62bc0aa8fd1e.mp4?t=1768210423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>FEAR FA 98</strong> proudly presents some of the official teams competing in our tournaments and leagues\u2014but remember, you can also create your own online by combining the players that best fit your play style!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sectarians</strong>: Fanatical players who follow their sinister creed with blind devotion, turning every match into a violent ritual.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serial Killers</strong>: Cold-blooded murderers who strike with precision and brutality, leaving a trail of terror across the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychopathic Nurses</strong>: Caregivers turned executioners, mixing medicine with malice as they prey on both teammates and rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2026and many more!</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3495990?t=1768210423","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/aa72e0928178a911ef217cd19a4eb8e11b720b5d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768210423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/9d036be78b7df57c448329d721e318d5f543e037/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768210423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/9d036be78b7df57c448329d721e318d5f543e037/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768210423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Juego de terror y futbol donde se puede utilizar la violencia en el campo de futbol, con graficos retro y humor negro."},"detailed_description":"<h1>THANKS TO OUR KICKSTARTER BACKERS, FEAR FA 98 IS POSSIBLE. MILLIONS OF THANKS TO EVERYONE!!!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/72ccd7c877a53836e9a11f8d22b26102.avif?t=1768210423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras_big/72ccd7c877a53836e9a11f8d22b26102.avif?t=1768210423 width=800 height=266 /></span></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/extras/fd85cafba251f74f029fc1917e23dfbd.poster.avif?t=1768210423\" width=878 height=460 ><source src=\"htt