ORCE GTX 1060 3 GB or AMD RADEON RX 580 4 GB</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft Windows 8, 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I7-8700K or AMD RYZEN 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GEFORCE GTX 1070 8 GB or AMD RADEON RX VEGA 56 8 GB</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Celery Emblem\u2122","Jacob Jazz"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nDrogas il\u00edcitas\nConte\u00fado sexual","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nSexuelle Inhalte\nDrogen","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cFear FA 98 is the Silent Hill meets Fifa 98 mashup we never knew we needed\u201d<br>The Guardian<br><br>\u201cSurvival horror clatters into soccer royalty as &quot;Silent Hill mixed with FIFA 98&quot; I could never have imagined would work this well\u201d<br>GamesRadar+<br><br>\u201cJazz's &quot;horror arcade soccer simulator&quot; is an unrepentant patchwork of ghoulish influences. It's a motley crew of influences on a wildly adventurous game, careless of genre constraints and determined to carve out its own niche.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/2e71a96e54dc369a860d00a818c9bdc28835e266/ss_2e71a96e54dc369a860d00a818c9bdc28835e266.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768210423","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495990/2e71a96e54dc369a860d00a818c9bdc28835e266/ss_2e71a96e54dc369a860d00a818c9bdc28835e266.600x338.jpg?t=1768210423"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steams